<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Grand RP – Plate Dealer Quick Sell Assistant (10,000)</Major>
    <Description>This macro is a Quality-of-Life assistant made specifically for the License Plate Dealer in Grand RP and can be used directly at the dealer.
It speeds up the repetitive selling workflow by automatically handling the input sequence (opening the interaction/chat step, entering the sell format, and pre-filling the price to 10,000), so you can complete sales faster and more consistently.

The macro is designed for active, in-front-of-the-dealer use and focuses on comfort + consistency: stable delays to reduce misinputs, and a panic stop for instant interruption at any time.
For Resolution use 1920x1080 than its working fine for you.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
